title: '`pallet-transaction-payment`: test the TxPaymentCredit API'

doc:
  - audience: Runtime Dev
    description: |
      Adds tests for the previously untested `withdraw_txfee`, `deposit_txfee` and
      `remaining_txfee` functions, and for the `on_finalize` cleanup of a credit left in
      storage between blocks. Test-only, no behavior change.

crates:
  - name: pallet-transaction-payment
    bump: none
